)\r\n- [Media] Add media control skill, currently available in English, French and Italian #287 (thanks @papjul!)\r\n- Allow using external Speech-To-Text apps as input devices #294 (thanks @woheller69!)\r\n    - Select this in the settings as a replacement for Vosk, which often does not provide good enough Speech-To-Text\r\n    - Any app that opens a popup when receiving the `ACTION_RECOGNIZE_SPEECH` intent should work\r\n    - Examples of apps that are known to work: woheller69's [whisperIME](https://f-droid.org/en/packages/org.woheller69.whisper/), [Kõnele](https://f-droid.org/packages/ee.ioc.phon.android.speak/), [Futo Voice Input](https://voiceinput.futo.org/) but even \"Speech Recognition and Synthesis from Google\"\r\n- Allow importing a custom wake word model for OpenWakeWord #291 (thanks @celskeggs!)\r\n    - If you can't pronounce \"Hey Dicio\" well enough, you might want to try out a custom wake word model\r\n    - You can download `.tflite` models of common wakeup words from [here](https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord/releases/tag/v0.5.1)\r\n    - You can even train your own wake word model and then import it in Dicio, see the instructions [here](https://github.com/Stypox/dicio-android/issues/238)\r\n- Play stop sound when no speech is detected #290 (thanks @celskeggs!)\r\n\r\n### Improved\r\n- [Weather] Shorten speech responses and support imperial units #283 (thanks @Inhishonor!)\r\n- If the user input could not be understood, ask to repeat and reopen microphone #296 (thanks @celskeggs!)\r\n- Give lower priority to capturing groups when doing to sentence matching\r\n- [Calculator] Improve English sentences #264 (thanks @Inhishonor!)\r\n- [Current time] Improve German current time sentences\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n- Fix inconsistent language after resuming app\r\n- Fix notification text not being expandable\r\n- [Search] Fix DuckDuckGo scraper\r\n\r\n### Development\r\n- Target SDK 36 and update dependencies #288 (thanks @papjul!)\r\n- Fix typo in README (thanks @Inhishonor!)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/210228023/reactions","total_count":13,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":3,"eyes":2},"mentions_count":5},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/177378044","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/177378044/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/177378044/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/tag/v2.0","id":177378044,"author":{"login":"Stypox","id":36421898,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NDIxODk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36421898?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox","html_url":"https://github.com/Stypox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stypox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOC-_0tM4KkpL8","tag_name":"v2.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"v2.0 - Wake word","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-09-27T22:46:46Z","updated_at":"2024-09-27T23:08:05Z","published_at":"2024-09-27T23:08:05Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DicioTeam/dicio-android/releases/assets/195430007","id":195430007,"node_id":"RA_kwDOC-_0tM4LpgZ3","name":"Dicio_2.0.apk","label":"","uploader":{"login